/// The second ISO-like format of the original: "<date> <time>" split at the
/// first U+0020, with relaxed field widths:
///
/// ```text
///   date: [+|-]Y+ [ -M{1,2} [ -D{1,2} ] ]
///   time: H{1,2} [ :m{1,2} [ :s{1,2} ] ] [ .f+ ] [ Z | (+|-)HH | (+|-)HHMM | (+|-)HH:MM ]
